TITLE Calcite kinetic reaction with Cu and Ba at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    -water 1

RATES
Calcite
-start
10 k = 10
20 sa = 1.0
30 rate = k * sa
40 moles = rate * TIME
50 if (moles > m) then moles = m
60 SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -formula CaCO3 1
        -steps 10 in 100*10
        -runge_kutta 3

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -totals C Cu
END
